{
  "name": "US Healthcare Provider & Clinic Leads (CMS NPI v2.1) -> Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~npi-healthcare-providers-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"search\",\n  \"taxonomyDescription\": \"Cardiology\",\n  \"state\": \"CA\",\n  \"enumerationType\": \"NPI-2\",\n  \"onlyWithPhone\": true,\n  \"maxResults\": 100\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-npi-call",
      "name": "Fetch US NPI Providers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-npi-number",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.npi}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-npi",
      "name": "Keep Valid NPI Providers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "NPI_Providers",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "npi": "={{$json.npi}}",
            "enumerationType": "={{$json.enumerationType}}",
            "providerName": "={{$json.providerName}}",
            "primarySpecialty": "={{$json.primarySpecialty}}",
            "practiceCity": "={{$json.practiceCity}}",
            "practiceState": "={{$json.practiceState}}",
            "practicePhone": "={{$json.practicePhone}}",
            "practiceFax": "={{$json.practiceFax}}",
            "authorizedOfficialName": "={{$json.authorizedOfficialName}}",
            "authorizedOfficialPhone": "={{$json.authorizedOfficialPhone}}",
            "nppesUrl": "={{$json.nppesUrl}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "npi"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert into Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1020,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## U.S. CMS NPPES NPI v2.1 Provider Extractor\n1. Set n8n env var `APIFY_TOKEN` (no hardcoded API keys).\n2. Customize `taxonomyDescription`, `state`, and `enumerationType` (`NPI-1` doctors or `NPI-2` clinics) in **Fetch US NPI Providers**.\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and click **Test Workflow**.",
        "height": 195,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Clean Deduplicated Output\n- **Keep Valid NPI Providers** ensures every row carries a 10-digit `npi`.\n- **Upsert into Google Sheets** deduplicates on `npi` and stores practice phone, fax, Authorized Official, and official NPPES link.",
        "height": 165,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-output",
      "name": "Validation & Upsert Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch US NPI Providers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch US NPI Providers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Valid NPI Providers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Valid NPI Providers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert into Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-npi-providers-template-v1"
  }
}
